# NOTE: Docker reads .dockerignore from the build context root, not from the
# directory containing the Dockerfile. Since all infra builds use context ".."
# (the repository root), the effective .dockerignore is /.dockerignore at the
# repo root. Edit that file, not this one.
#
# This file is intentionally a stub so the infra/ directory documents the
# convention. See /.dockerignore for the actual exclusion list.
